[{"title":"送潘令之邯郸 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"赵家和璧旧知名，千载秦人说蔺生。\n莫道君才非百里，须将高价抵连城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24846,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘令之邯郸 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"邯郸出宰气何雄，伫日徵书奉汉宫。\n制锦但令成五色，如花岂羡鲍家骢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山斋牡丹 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"醉把名花掌上新，空山开处几回春。\n西施自爱倾城色，一出吴宫不嫁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山斋牡丹 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"西山风雨锦溪寒，春色沈沈醉牡丹。\n不是故人裁丽句，那能萧瑟病中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山斋牡丹 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"青山缭绕树横斜，中有柴桑令尹家。\n白发几回能载酒，春风何处不看花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过殿卿山房咏牡丹 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"相国园亭种牡丹，枝枝风雨怨春寒。\n主人车马城中惯，知傍谁家锦障看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过殿卿山房咏牡丹 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"国色宫妆倚槛新，一樽堪自对残春。\n即令解语应相笑，何必看花定主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24852,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘山人不值 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"主人三径草堂斜，稚子开门劝吃茶。\n自有白云看好客，不妨红叶满贫家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24853,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘山人不值 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"南窗狼藉半床书，阶下苍苔罢扫除。\n似是邻翁邀作社，不然应钓锦川鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24854,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑将军之铜江 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"汉将承恩意气多，楼船十道下牂牁。\n怜君本自山东妙，更许何人系尉佗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24855,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑将军之铜江 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"铜柱遥临幕府高，武陵溪水日滔滔。\n桃花不及骅骝色，并与春光照锦袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24856,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑将军之铜江 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"白羽如林汉主分，万山遥护长官军。\n大铜江上门生笛，不是南征不可闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24857,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑将军之铜江 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"射策当年捕虏才，提兵又度百蛮来。\n秋霜已避横戈气，春雁应同结阵回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24858,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答殿卿问疾","author":"李攀龙","text":"斜阳残雪照楼中，忽枉新诗字字工。\n无那主人便伏枕，十年不肯让春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24859,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏问殿卿止酒状","author":"李攀龙","text":"昨夜春风吹酒香，床头瓮瓮菊脂黄。\n当垆笑杀如花妾，底事垂涎若个长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24860,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楼上","author":"李攀龙","text":"白云湖上白云还，浊酒新诗日日閒。\n无那满楼春雪色，教人常对玉函山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24861,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁得元美兄弟书却寄","author":"李攀龙","text":"春风忽送雁行回，病客新衔白雪杯。\n一度三江声自苦，君家兄弟寄书来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24862,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"止酒","author":"李攀龙","text":"五柳先生漉酒巾，萧然东壁挂青春。\n远公此日应相笑，也学莲花社里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24863,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答张秀才简病中见寄 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"一瓢春酒一渔矶，羡尔江湖老布衣。\n此日故人谁问疾，柴门深闭雪霏霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24864,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答张秀才简病中见寄 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"裘马翩翩自昔时，谁怜华发卧茅茨。\n世情一薄如春雪，不是穷交那得知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24865,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金台郑参戎 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"征南幕府百蛮遥，拟勒功名宠圣朝。\n此日汉家铜柱在，何如海上赤城标。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24866,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金台郑参戎 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"帝遣楼船护海乡，旌旗十万下东阳。\n何来剑气辕门上，夜夜遥看婺女光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24867,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答殿卿过饮南楼见赠 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"二月城头柳半黄，金枝袅袅挂斜阳。\n已知不及春醪色，自起开尊唤客尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24868,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答殿卿过饮南楼见赠 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"南楼雪后忆离群，湖上衔杯弄白云。\n也道酒如春水薄，尊前无日好无君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24869,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许长史玉函宫携妓 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"玉函宫里列红颜，美酒清尊醉不还。\n春色自应天上好，那嗔长史出人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24870,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许长史玉函宫携妓 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"清都花发彩云深，片月高悬玉树林。\n此夕应逢秦女醉，新诗偷得凤箫吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24871,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"汉家高宴柏梁台，千载风云拥上才。\n谁得似君珠履贵，亲承咳唾九天来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24872,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"曾游上国和阳春，华发重来一曲新。\n身自楚臣谁不识，兰台宾客更无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24873,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"一片燕山紫气中，汉家城阙蓟门东。\n即今天子招贤地，非复当年碣石宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24874,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"五云西北望京华，玉帛年年出汉家。\n此去但承明主问，不妨才子更长沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24875,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"乞得梁园出汉关，那将春色动离颜。\n惟愁不见邹枚苦，赋就无人解往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24876,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其六","author":"李攀龙","text":"万国称藩拱至尊，一时词客出王门。\n但教日奉西园宴，莫道应刘不是恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24877,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其七","author":"李攀龙","text":"金舆山下小清河，河上朱楼叠素波。\n此日为君西北望，浮云不似客愁多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24878,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其八","author":"李攀龙","text":"桃花美酒凤凰楼，公子乘春作宦游。\n寒食不知何处过，总无风雨亦堪愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24879,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其九","author":"李攀龙","text":"胡姬十五汉宫妆，夹道杨花扑面香。\n处处红楼堪系马，莫教春色断君肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24880,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其十","author":"李攀龙","text":"春风忽断雁行疏，染翰青云照锦裾。\n知尔已传招隐赋，相思更寄枕中书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24881,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其十一","author":"李攀龙","text":"秦女窗前桂叶垂，那堪春色斗双眉。\n君家自种淮南树，处处淹留好为谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24882,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送右史之京 其十二","author":"李攀龙","text":"春光明日是长安，杨柳青青傍酒寒。\n也自道君为客好，那应犹作故园看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24883,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿开元寺示诸子","author":"李攀龙","text":"三十年前住此峰，白云流水见相从。\n那知此日东林会，更听开元寺里钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24884,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重寄伯承","author":"李攀龙","text":"桃花不似玉颜红，顾影扬蛾入汉宫。\n才说长门人便老，黄金无赋买春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24885,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答殿卿潞河旅次见忆之作","author":"李攀龙","text":"十载萧条作逐臣，长安明日更逢春。\n那能不醉新丰酒，且自江湖忆故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24886,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锦阳川途中醉归答刘山人","author":"李攀龙","text":"锦溪人醉接䍦斜，邀客看花右史家。\n右史未归休下马，长安城里正看花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24887,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答右史于都城见卖牡丹者因忆故园之作 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"上苑繁华此一时，牡丹偏媚汉宫姿。\n故园春色无人赏，零落空山只自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24888,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答右史于都城见卖牡丹者因忆故园之作 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"长安何处买花还，玉女窗前两度攀。\n可惜汉宫都不管，一枝春色借人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24889,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周象贤明府明卿门人属感明卿放逐因赠明府","author":"李攀龙","text":"金马风流汉主恩，一时冠盖尽王孙。\n不知泽畔行吟日，那得周郎却在门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24890,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠周象贤明府","author":"李攀龙","text":"汉家当日渡兰津，铜柱西南尽外臣。\n才子似君难便得，始知元不为巴人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24891,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为周真阳题芭蕉仕女图戏呈吴明卿使君","author":"李攀龙","text":"春尽芭蕉未著花，玉兰双倚丽人斜。\n何如南郡从游日，一面红妆出绛纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24892,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为周真阳诣徐使君得报使有感作此赠 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"使君清怨满江皋，汝海秋深尺素劳。\n当日往还门下吏，那知犹有范功曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24893,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为周真阳诣徐使君得报使有感作此赠 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"使君南国有诗名，属吏风流思亦清。\n今日新林还罢郡，几人犹似在宣城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24894,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春寄吴使君 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"十载风流动帝都，只今漂泊满江湖。\n那能万里褰帷处，不忆中原一病夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24895,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春寄吴使君 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"从他白发病中生，浊酒宁知世上情。\n才到蓬蒿人自转，非干仲蔚欲逃名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24896,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春寄吴使君 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"越王台上草萋萋，楚客褰帷五马嘶。\n那意故人将锦字，春风吹到七闽西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24897,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春寄吴使君 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"五马遥临百粤春，汉家迁客虎符新。\n同时谏猎堪谁在，得领专城更几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24898,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"殿卿乞酒作此寄报 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"遥传锦札雁池来，问我看春醉几回。\n消渴未能常傍酒，乞君携客上平台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24899,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"殿卿乞酒作此寄报 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"新开金掌露华香，赠尔梁园唤客尝。\n酒赋若还遗此品，可须浮白劳邹阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24900,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘子方斗酒","author":"李攀龙","text":"每到花开忆锦溪，春醪今日为君携。\n山中傥值看花伴，醉里新诗好共题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24901,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏东张茂才","author":"李攀龙","text":"罗姑春酒百花香，潦倒张郎自不妨。\n为问君家三妇艳，今朝若个画眉长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24902,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为许右史悼伎 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"翩翩春色梦中微，泪尽红颜湿舞衣。\n似爱主人能作赋，化为流雪兔园飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24903,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为许右史悼伎 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"梁园脩竹孝王栽，散入秋风绕吹台。\n此夜断肠听不得，月明池上雁还来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24904,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招张少坤","author":"李攀龙","text":"萧萧落木下河干，秋老东林白露寒。\n为报陶家新酒熟，黄花三径待君看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24905,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽耿蠡县 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"百里风云接帝闱，故园春色动芳菲。\n知君自是神仙令，此日双凫何处飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24906,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽耿蠡县 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"春色孤城病里看，谁怜白发汉郎官。\n蠡吾城下秋风起，千载萧萧易水寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24907,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽杨生 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"翠羽明珠映掌新，君家长是武陵春。\n一时红泪千行下，肠断君家有几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24908,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感逝示克懋","author":"李攀龙","text":"春风吹动故人情，昨夜山阳玉笛声。\n若使红颜偏绂冕，谁将白发老诸生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24909,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袭克懋托疾不肯入试赋赠","author":"李攀龙","text":"白发萧萧一布衣，秋风摇落雁南飞。\n如何自听朱弦绝，此调人间识者稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24910,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十日陶令过东村","author":"李攀龙","text":"樽前无恙满篱花，柳亦萧萧映日斜。\n正好故人成一醉，风流那不似君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24911,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子与以服散卧病因赋姬人怨服散三章戏赠 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"洞房春满百花明，月底红颜把玉笙。\n道是神仙君不信，人间那得凤凰鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24912,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子与以服散卧病因赋姬人怨服散三章戏赠 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"吴姬捣药楚姬丸，独夜深闺玉兔寒。\n更倚庭前双桂树，何人不作月中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24913,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简许殿卿","author":"李攀龙","text":"玉函山色倚嵯峨，北渚清秋已自波。\n我欲与君携酒去，不知何处白云多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24914,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许右史寄怀曾水部之作 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"右史怀人弄彩毫，华阳秋送白云高。\n遥知水部开椷处，不独钟山照锦袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24915,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许右史寄怀曾水部之作 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"鸿书摇落度江来，为忆风流许掾才。\n曾是支公门下客，秋光偏在雨花台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24916,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中答寄殿卿","author":"李攀龙","text":"大梁车骑日如云，客散夷门酒半醺。\n更向古人论意气，不知谁似信陵君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24917,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和聂仪部明妃曲 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"青海长云万里秋，琵琶一曲泪先流。\n六宫多少良家子，不到沙场不解愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24918,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和聂仪部明妃曲 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"玉门关外起秋风，双鬓萧条傍转蓬。\n怪得红颜零落尽，春光只在合欢宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24919,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和聂仪部明妃曲 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"天山雪后北风寒，抱得琵琶马上弹。\n曲罢不知青海月，徘徊犹作汉宫看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24920,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和聂仪部明妃曲 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"燕支山下几回春，坐使蛾眉误此身。\n二八汉宫含笑入，一时红粉更无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24921,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重别魏使君 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"楚客褰帷不可留，阳春一曲更难酬。\n并将别后萧条色，写向君家白雪楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24922,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重别魏使君 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"谢客园林已十春，门前车马任红尘。\n使君不为怜同调，何处蓬蒿得故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24923,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]